@startuml
left to right direction
actor Applicant
actor "Bank Officer" as Officer
rectangle TrustFinAI {
  usecase "Submit loan application" as UC1
  usecase "View decision and explanations" as UC2
  usecase "View submitted form" as UC3
  usecase "Explore affordability scenario" as UC4
  usecase "Preview / download PDF" as UC5
  usecase "Upload batch" as UC6
  usecase "Review application history" as UC7
  usecase "Inspect evaluation details" as UC8
}
Applicant --> UC1
Applicant --> UC2
Applicant --> UC3
Applicant --> UC4
Applicant --> UC5
Officer --> UC1
Officer --> UC2
Officer --> UC5
Officer --> UC6
Officer --> UC7
Officer --> UC8
note bottom of TrustFinAI
Portal modes are presentation choices;
server-side authentication is not implemented.
end note
@enduml
